   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Trade Centre (ITC)</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lao PDR: ASEAN Regional Integration Support (Laos-ARISE Plus)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The ARISE Plus Lao PDR programme contributes to the integration of the Lao economy into global production chains through targeted support to both the public and private sectors, with a focus on smallholders and SMEs. It concerns the specifically targeted sectors Wood processing and Coffee. The project aims at contributing to a sustainable growth in Lao PDR through job creation and mitigation of vulnerability, via three expected outputs: (1) an increased regional integration, (2) enhanced benefits from trade opportunities and market linkages with potential markets, and (3) an improved participation in global value chains of the two selected sectors.</narrative>
  </description>
